This directory contains additional toppar files specific for PHMD

1. phmd_gbsw_g5.in
 - model compound PMF parameters for GBSW phmd

2. phmd_hybrid_g2.in
 - model compound PMF parameters for hybrid solvent pHMD (GBSW + TIP3P[pme])

3. ephmd_rxnfield.in
 - model compound PMF parameters for explicit solvent pHMD with generalized 
   reaction field electrostatics (cutoff = 14 angstroms)
 - Commented out Jason's Asp parameters (OD1 and OD2 in ASP1 switched)
   Shane redid the work
 - Commented out Jason's Glu parameters (optimized based on HpHMD results)
   Wei redid from scratch 

4. top_all22_prot_cmap_phmd.inp & par_all22_prot_cmap_phmd.inp
 - top_all22_prot_cmap.inp & par_all22_prot_cmap.inp with added/modified parameters for carboxyl groups
   for CpHMD simulations

5. top_all22_prot_cmap_ephmd.inp & par_all22_prot_cmap_ephmd.inp 
 - all22 toppar with : 
   a. modified SOD vdW and SOD-CLA/SOD-O interaction distance
   b. TIP3P hydronium ion topology and parameters
   c. TIP3P hydroxide ion topology and parameters

6. toppar_water_ions.str
 - added a nbfix term for sodium-carbonyl oxygen (SOD-O) to the original toppar_water_ions.str in toppar_c36_aug12

7. toppar_phmd.str
 - combination of topology and parameters for PHMD
 - must be read in after main toppar files

8. phmd_hybrid_g2_shane.in
 - lastest version (also the one used with distributed C27 FF)

9. top_all22_prot_cmap_ephmd_shane.inp & par_all22_prot_cmap_ephmd_shane.inp
 - heme top&par updated according to C36 FF
